<br />

<br />
I have no kos issues with any players.
<br />
I have no sponsors as of yet,  but will start working on that right away.  I have deguilded from IF to be free to pursue the recruitment process.  I am not applying to any other guilds.
<br />

<br />
If you have any questions,  feel free to /t me in game,  I usually play 6-7 nights a week,  9pm -? sun thru thurs,  and a good chunk of the day on fri and sat.
